modes and you will see keys press down.", "short_description": "A VR piano learning app for Oculus Quest"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "491991228712757", "locale": "cs_CZ", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "VRtuos", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Zkalibrujte si sv\u00e9 opravdov\u00e9 pi\u00e1no a hrajte! Noty padaj\u00ed p\u0159\u00edmo na kl\u00e1vesy, tak\u017ee nau\u010dit se novou skladbu nen\u00ed \u017eadn\u00fd probl\u00e9m. Vyberte si z mnoha skladeb, nebo si importujte vlastn\u00ed .mid soubory.\n\nPokud m\u00e1te midi piano, m\u016f\u017eete si ho s aplikac\u00ed propojit s Companionem z https://vrtuos.eu. D\u00edky n\u011bmu se v\u00e1m otev\u0159ou dal\u0161\u00ed dva m\u00f3dy a tak\u00e9 uvid\u00edte stisknut\u00e9 kl\u00e1vesy p\u0159\u00edmo ve h\u0159e.", "short_description": "VR aplikace kter\u00e1 v\u00e1s nau\u010d\u00ed hr\u00e1t na piano"}]}, "developer_name": "Pavel Marceluch", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vrtuos.eu/PrivacyPolicy.txt", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://vrtuos.eu/#eula", "publisher_name": "Pavel Marceluch", "support_website_url": "http://vrtuos.eu/eula.html", "website_url": "https://vrtuos.eu/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ART_CREATIVITY", "EDUCATIONAL", "MUSIC"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "cs", "fr", "de", "ru", "sv"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1388501858248200"}, "review_me